  "id": "positive-addiction",
  "term": "positive addiction",
  "definition": "Positive addiction is an addiction-like state that is experienced as beneficial or adaptive rather than mainly harmful. In this source, intense romantic love is described as a natural example because it can involve craving, dependence, and reward-system activation while also serving pair-bonding and reproduction.",
